    "title": "Kids A-Z",
    "description": "Blast off into a universe of learning with Kids A-Z! Navigate through an interactive space-themed portal to discover learning planets filled with stellar eBooks and educational activities. Tackle quizzes and monitor progress from your own command center dashboard wherever you go. Crafted for students in grades K-5, this app ensures a cosmic learning journey, online and offline. Safety is prioritized with robust privacy features. \ud83d\ude80\u2728 Download and explore today!\r\n\r\nThe Kids A-Z app is free to download and enables mobile access to any Learning A-Z solution including: \r\n\u2022 Raz-Plus\r\n\u2022 Raz-Kids\r\n\u2022 Foundations A-Z\r\n\u2022 Writing A-Z\r\n\u2022 Science A-Z\r\n\u2022 Vocabulary A-Z",
